nfidence": null}, {"t_ms": 53653, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017tARbGQn1gqJLgVyM2s5eF", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53653, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017tARbGQn1gqJLgVyM2s5eF", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55320, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01GaXJthyXtWAwvYz2FrZ9Vu", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55620, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GaXJthyXtWAwvYz2FrZ9Vu", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55620, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GaXJthyXtWAwvYz2FrZ9Vu", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 60860, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Starting point:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an error rate of about 18%.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy, but only in staging.\n- **First attempt:** it stopped with an orchestrator error after updating us-east, so regions were briefly on different versions.\n- **Retry:** I ran the same rollback again, which was safe because us-east was already on v2.3.0. It finished in all regions.\n- **Result:** checkout-api is now healthy, with an error rate of about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created anyway. I didn't retry, so the on-call engineer was paged only once.\n- The incident describes what failed and the rollback steps, including the partial failure. It also lists three follow-ups:\n  - find what broke in v2.3.1\n  - investigate the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback\n  - find out why v2.3.1 went to production when its staging release candidate was unhealthy", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01GmfBTkUWBjZhfz1sgGdKig", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011yXWYTwtc41qhdN7q58RFr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XS1qU7eV1mZ3XYdxBdNBsE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01XGi4UmUv5VG6ZbuinZ8yka", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Rollback stopped partway: only us-east moved to v2.3.0. Rolling back to the same version again is safe because us-east is already there, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RETpFUTvaKRqFHnuEQ3wpv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "che